        465,
        1250,
        1251,
        1343
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. An Occupational Safety and Health Planning Task Force is hereby created consisting of the Director of Construction who shall serve as Chairman, the Commissioner of Health, the Director of Management and Budget, the Director of the Department of Personnel, the Corporation Counsel and the Director of the Office of Labor Relations, each of whom may, in writing, designate a representative to serve on the task force in his stead.",
      "logprob_stats": {
